## Processed artifacts (written by `code/`)

`code/prepare_<study>.py` reads the raw open data and emits the tvbo-ready `Network`
(`input/<study>_grid.{yaml,h5}`) plus small human-readable `.npz`/`.csv` for inspection.
These are **derived intermediates, not the source**. Do not hand-edit them.
